### EsportsHub — Demo rezim: mecevi se igraju sami kroz RabbitMQ
### Run all (⏩). Prvo pokreni demo-reset.http da baza ima Sarajevo Open.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Admin login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usernameOrEmail": "admin", "password": "admin12345" }

> {% client.global.set("demoAdmin", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Pokreni demo (bez tijela = Sarajevo Open ili bilo koji turnir u toku)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/demo/start
Authorization: Bearer {{demoAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3. Status { running, tournamentId, liveMatches, snapshotsSent, startedAt }
GET {{host}}/api/admin/demo/status
Authorization: Bearer {{demoAdmin}}

### 4. Mecevi uzivo (javno)
GET {{host}}/api/matches/live

### 5. Zaustavi demo
POST {{host}}/api/admin/demo/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{demoAdmin}}
